  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AB_zU9itRncuoaa" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000935" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetActivityTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89B_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetActivityTableTextBlock_zZXDvTE4AsF2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following table presents a roll-forward of EDGEAI for the six months ended June 30, 2026:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8BD_zmzb9nB1uoTc" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF ROLL FORWARD OF CRYPTO ASSETS</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td>&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" id="xdx_49F_20260101__20260630__srt--CryptoAssetAxis__custom--EDGEAITokensMember_zltqKlZoVkX5" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center">EDGEAI</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td>&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center">US$&#8217;000</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr id="xdx_40E_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetFairValue_iS_pn3n3_zlSAhMFjboX7" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="width: 80%">Balance on December 31, 2025</td><td style="width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">$</td><td style="width: 16%; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_EDGEAITokensMember" id="Fact000937" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">401,963</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr id="xdx_40E_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetRealizedGainLossOperating_pn3n3_zZ1ZZOnUbx4h" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="padding-left: 10pt; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 1pt">Loss on fair value changes of crypto assets</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: right">(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetRealizedGainLossOperating" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_custom_EDGEAITokensMember" id="Fact000939" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" sign="-" unitRef="USD">186,970</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; text-align: left">)</td></tr>
  <tr id="xdx_40E_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetFairValue_iE_pn3n3_z65L6bEUUEn8" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">Balance on June 30, 2026</td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">$</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetFairValue" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_EDGEAITokensMember" id="Fact000941" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">214,993</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zspNsnO2EJyg" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Crypto assets
(consisting solely of EDGEAI) are measured at fair value at the reporting date. EDGEAI are native tokens operating on the EDGEAI Mainnet.
There were no changes in the quantity of crypto assets held during the six months ended June 30, 2026. The fair value of EDGEAI is determined using the quoted closing median price on the Company&#8217;s principal market, PancakeSwap v3, a decentralized
exchange. As of June 30, 2026, EDGEAI had limited trading activity and market depth and was not identified as trading on other significant
markets. Accordingly, management applied a 20% discount for lack of marketability to the quoted price to reflect the liquidity characteristics
of the market and the Company&#8217;s significant holding relative to available market liquidity. The adjustment does not reflect the size of
the Company&#8217;s specific holding or an assumed liquidation of the Company&#8217;s position. As the discount represents a significant unobservable
input, the fair value measurement is classified within Level 3 of the fair value hierarchy. Risks associated with the Company&#8217;s
cryptocurrency holdings are set out in Note 4(c).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Termination
of Staking Agreement</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 6, 2026, the Company entered into a one-year staking agreement with the EDGEAI Foundation pursuant to which <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetNumberOfUnits_iI_pid_uInteger_c20260106__srt--CryptoAssetAxis__custom--EDGEAITokensMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember_zA9CWvIisLtk" title="Quantity"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnits" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-06_custom_EDGEAITokensMember_custom_TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember" id="Fact000943" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">157,453,325</ix:nonFraction></span>
EDGEAI were subject to a 12-month staking period with floating annualized rewards of <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--CryptoAssetFloatingAnnualizedYield_pid_dp_c20260106__20260106__srt--CryptoAssetAxis__custom--EDGEAITokensMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zeYpTj9o9YUj" title="Crypto asset floating annualized yield"><ix:nonFraction name="DCX:CryptoAssetFloatingAnnualizedYield" contextRef="From2026-01-062026-01-06_custom_EDGEAITokensMember_custom_TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000945" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%-<span id="xdx_901_ecustom--CryptoAssetFloatingAnnualizedYield_pid_dp_c20260106__20260106__srt--CryptoAssetAxis__custom--EDGEAITokensMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zzyjEMJq4Xwd" title="Crypto asset floating annualized yield"><ix:nonFraction name="DCX:CryptoAssetFloatingAnnualizedYield" contextRef="From2026-01-062026-01-06_custom_EDGEAITokensMember_custom_TerminationOfStakingAgreementMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000947" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8</ix:nonFraction></span>%.
On May 18, 2026, the Company and the EDGEAI Foundation mutually agreed to terminate the staking agreement. Upon termination, the staking
arrangement ceased and the related tokens were released from the staking arrangement. No staking rewards were earned or received and no
material penalties or other liabilities arose from the termination. As of June 30, 2026, no EDGEAI tokens were subject to the staking
arrangement.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 20 -->
